# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for `make test-tsan`.
#
# oc_config_load: a few suites start a second event loop with different
# settings (a trusted forwarder, a token prefix, no voice input) while the
# suite's main loop still runs, and that loop reloads the configuration the
# first one reads. Only the tests reconfigure a running process; the daemon
# loads its configuration once, before any thread starts (config.h).
race:oc_config_load
